HUMAN_REVIEW.\",\"STRICT_CONTEMPORANEOUS_PIT_NOT_PROVEN: CNINFO provided date-level times and retained files were acquired after the research cutoff.\"],\"last_material_event_check\":\"2026-10-16\",\"model_as_of\":\"2026-10-16\",\"model_id\":\"residual-income-equity-shared-dated-v2\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"valid_from\":\"2026-10-16\"},\"next_events\":[{\"evidence_refs\":[\"cninfo_1225608903\",\"cninfo_1225603532\",\"cninfo_1225603533\",\"cninfo_1225603534\"],\"kind\":\"fact\",\"text\":\"人工复核临时股东会决议、法律意见、注册资本减少及最新回购进展公告。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"midea_2026h1\"],\"kind\":\"gap\",\"text\":\"下一期定期报告发布后复核利润、现金转换和ROE路径。\"}],\"portfolio_input_status\":\"BLOCKED_PRIVATE_INPUT\",\"position_guidance\":null,\"price_attractiveness_status\":\"NOT_ASSESSABLE\",\"price_bridge_status\":\"INVALID\",\"recommendation_payload_sha256\":\"98744ad4260b250f14874b63061f8a67d8e5ec204f8334ee0b6164be2c041cf2\",\"recommendation_reasons\":[\"DRAFT_NOT_APPROVED\",\"EVENT_MATERIALITY_PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW\",\"EVENT_COVERAGE_INCOMPLETE\",\"STRICT_CONTEMPORANEOUS_PIT_NOT_PROVEN\",\"ECONOMIC_PARAMETERS_NOT_VALIDATED\",\"G1_财务门\",\"G3_估值门\",\"event scan coverage is incomplete\",\"EVENT_COVERAGE_INCOMPLETE: the CNINFO snapshot was captured before the research day closed.\",\"Four 2026-10-14 and 2026-10-17 announcements remain PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW.\",\"STRICT_CONTEMPORANEOUS_PIT_NOT_PROVEN: CNINFO provided date-level times and retained files were acquired after the research cutoff.\",\"price_bridge_invalid\",\"CANDIDATE_DRAFT_ASSUMPTIONS_NOT_HUMAN_VALIDATED\",\"CANDIDATE_DRAFT_ASSUMPTION_NOT_HUMAN_VALIDATED\",\"research_case:DRAFT_NOT_APPROVED\",\"research_case:EVENT_MATERIALITY_PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW\",\"research_case:EVENT_COVERAGE_INCOMPLETE\",\"research_case:STRICT_CONTEMPORANEOUS_PIT_NOT_PROVEN\",\"research_case:ECONOMIC_PARAMETERS_NOT_VALIDATED\",\"research_scope_not_approved\",\"research_case_valuation_not_approved\",\"valuation_status_not_approved_for_research\",\"model_validity_unknown\",\"event_materiality_review_unavailable\",\"decision_dependency_artifacts_unavailable\",\"predecision_eligibility_unavailable\",\"price assessment profile does not match valuation\",\"human_research_approval_not_resolved\"],\"recommendation_type\":\"NO_ACTION\",\"reduce_zone\":null,\"run_id\":\"midea-economic-review-ready-20261021T193106744906Z\",\"schema_version\":\"advisory-decision-recommendation-v2\",\"symbol\":\"000333\",\"thesis\":\"同期H1加权ROE11.33%对11.29%，不能由半年/全年误比认定恶化。扣非下降涉及汇兑与风险管理工具分类不对称，不能等同主业等幅下降。规模、渠道、全球化及ToB增长支持研究资本回报持续性，毛利率与销量反证限制外推。全部旧ROE及终端参数仅保留为低置信待审条件。\",\"thesis_breakers\":[{\"evidence_refs\":[\"midea_2026h1\"],\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"text\":\"若未来两年ROE持续低于9%的候选权益门槛，剩余收益假设失效。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"midea_2026h1\"],\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"text\":\"若利润下降伴随经营现金转换和资产负债表质量同步恶化，当前底部ROE路径仍需下调。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"midea_202606_hkex_monthly_return\",\"cninfo_1225608903\",\"cninfo_1225603532\",\"cninfo_1225603533\",\"cninfo_1225603534\"],\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"text\":\"若股本注销、回购或分红导致普通股分母与可分配现金桥接发生变化，必须重算每股价值。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"midea-economic-v1-proposal\"],\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"text\":\"新同口径定期披露改变利润/毛利率/现金转换或资本回报判断。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"midea-economic-v1-proposal\"],\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"text\":\"已披露资本、库存股、回购注销、分配或重大公告改变输入。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"midea-economic-v1-proposal\"],\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"text\":\"可核验新工具范围、税后归属或OCI桥足以改变正常化解释。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"midea-economic-v1-proposal\"],\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"text\":\"独立审核否定持续期、权益成本、分配或终端经济依据。\"}],\"valuation_range\":{\"base\":\"45.7417037044192281574936570926129861357849631511\",\"basis\":\"valuation_result\",\"bear\":\"36.0121866604528720800629631840921914063801838080\",\"bull\":\"58.1686744055803340295467634666441075299523416697\",\"currency\":\"CNY\"}}",
